### Competitive Programming extension caches ###
# CPH (Competitive Programming Helper, VS Code) and JHelper (IntelliJ) keep
# their own problem/testcase databases. Sample I/O for problems is committed
# under problems/**/tests/ instead, so these caches are safe to ignore.
**/.cph/
**/.autocp

